Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nemesis:=20round-7=20=E2=80=94=20inline=20citat?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ion=20pills,=20PDF=20thumbnails,=20Library=20tabs,=20no=20emoji?=
