MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Inline source pills under each assistant answer (message-sources.tsx; text-level
  citations via sourcesFromText; renders only after the turn completes)
- Sources refactor: makeSink/harvestText shared by rail + inline pills; badges are
  plain text now (PubMed/FDA/Trial), red uppercase, no emojis anywhere
- Artifacts page (student): web links excluded — citations live in Sources, not
  Artifacts; Link filter chip hidden
- PdfViewer: thumbnail side rail (lazy mini renders, click-to-jump, active ring)
  + Page x/y readout from scroll position
- Library: Obsidian-style tabs (open/refocus/close; freshest note per render)
- Emoji sweep: tabler icons replace file/mic/lock/pause glyphs
- Student build: 'Branch in new chat' relabeled 'Continue in a new chat';
  panes-flip titlebar toggle hidden
- school-portal skill (Blackboard + Outlook web extraction, never-submit rules)
